&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HMYvdEYlLoNg8uxqFp2lguHqgYd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUQtdSqjkoARkExE7OLlUczGg1h&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iuoldc19boZMqOx1aTJluxDGg0b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QXOSdoLu6o8o6WxKgYQlkWrAgcf&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JWE6d1gvxoL9t9x74lgl5iiggsd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A2zDdYwaqocW2FxGzdIlVpgJgMh&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P89Zdbksro7KmhxJpF0lrgFhgie&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KKX6dk629o1ZSAxXVgqleySggRb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yj3fdf5IYojoTUxwG7ylCkuEg6b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Dx3odHflso12d5xnUz2lDdXSg3c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DyvmdeMUHoH2wxxvWR2likHjgZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IfCsdun1Uo946sxsGKGlTXTugcg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Institutional Client Development &amp;amp; Acquisition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LkG5dBbJwodaWsxcWOXlFNO1gQf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proactively identify and develop high-value institutional clients with significant asset scale and trading potential, including professional investment firms, asset management companies, quantitative trading teams, and family offices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JBFZdglUpoXngIxlF9MlwCzKgxd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build a consistent client pipeline through industry events, peer referrals, and in-person visits, and drive partnerships to closure efficiently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MUumdNp8Vo5gVBxaY3JlbcfMgzh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Relationship Management &amp;amp; Client Lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
