&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YMoNdUfPPot0MhxVDfDleBFqg1e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop a thorough understanding of each client&#39;s trading strategy, capital structure, and product needs, and deliver tailored service solutions accordingly.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DVmOdy0MHo6c6rxEUgwlmTJRgyb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain regular and in-depth engagement with clients, foster long-term trust-based relationships, and continuously drive growth in assets under management, trading activity, and platform stickiness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZZhdyhIYoGUyUxtJGYl16QdgRd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Ownership &amp;amp; Business Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
