&lt;div&gt;Take full ownership of key performance metrics for your client portfolio, including AUM, trading volume, and revenue contribution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PduxdTAfuoWdptxwkz1ljdNCg9d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Consistently meet monthly and quarterly targets for asset onboarding and business activation, and optimize client value output over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4f8dS9WYo9fndxhyrKlUtRJgyb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Product Sales&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Igqddx8cpoyZVuxndvclqT7sgkD&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop deep expertise across the platform&#39;s full product suite — including spot, derivatives, structured products, and institution-exclusive services — and provide tailored product recommendations based on each client&#39;s investment strategy and business objectives, helping clients optimize returns or achieve risk management goals.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R4AXdOlJwo4jaMxPiajlppdyg5f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Needs Synthesis &amp;amp; Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
