&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QJMBddSGxoXUGsxYgpIlbiO0gdc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proactively provide clients with market insights and professional guidance at critical moments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HN9ddZGE7oXwGBxpmNMlQr4Xg8f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Competitive Tracking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SOnWdzrMeooIMcx2K3qlMAt6gqd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Stay current on institutional crypto market trends and competitor service strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GDkHdNxAuoz8UXx1jislfEtXgHn&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Regularly share market intelligence and client feedback internally to inform product development and business strategy.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QFRgdyf2poMWPmxkRn2lnjE0gCb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;高净值机构客户开发与拓展&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CvlUdmsQOoHNcExNSEOlMLdIgRb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;主动挖掘并开发具备高资产规模与高交易潜力的优质机构客户，目标群体涵盖专业投资机构、资产管理公司、量化团队等。通过行业活动、同业转介、线下拜访等多元渠道持续建立客户漏斗，快速识别高潜力目标并推动合作落地。&lt;/div&gt;
