&lt;div&gt;Experience in the Web3 industry, with hands-on usage or service experience related to major exchanges, wallets, custody solutions, DeFi products, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JD71dk1VfoPufUxvOeplMUhOgAe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Able to quickly identify and qualify target clients, with strong communication, negotiation and relationship-building skills. Experience in managing high-potential client relationships, client service or account operations is preferred. Basic understanding of financial markets, derivatives and risk–return; background in banking, securities or asset management is a strong plus.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VXoAd1Gp3oPLsbxpKIrl1rtLgRb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Clear KPI &amp;amp; result orientation, and comfortable using data to measure and manage performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RA61dbP65oqHl9xWfbjlKwYOgSf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfortable with a high-intensity work pace and frequent travel / client visits.&lt;/div&gt;
