&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H9D0dfgSfoLkhrxgiMxlVTLRgNn&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong self-motivation and resilience, able to find paths forward and drive execution in an uncertain environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HgvGdLVbqoEjhAxu4ZllLPECgGd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Able to work in both Chinese and English (listening, speaking, reading and writing).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V25cdpGenoJrNSxq80qlssClgPg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor’s degree or above; majors in Finance, Economics, Accounting, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science or related fields are preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H1u2d3w9voW0bXxi0lEl4XhugUc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;\web3 行业工作经验，对主流交易所、钱包、托管、DeFi 等产品有实际使用或服务经验&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AT4udsdyGo5z4MxVVSClQ2h6gud&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;能够快速识别与筛选目标客户，具备优秀的沟通谈判技巧与关系维护能力，有高潜力客户的客户关系管对金融市场、衍生品、风险收益等有基本认知，有银行、券商、资管等金融背景者优先。客户服务和运营等相关工作经验优先；&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z8VrdHtHgozCssx8oAClf8u9gtd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;明确的KPI &amp;amp; 结果导向，习惯用数据衡量业绩。能接受高强度工作节奏与频繁出差 / 拜访。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L4UwdSrElo8fZTxB1ovlO0jkgaf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;能适应高强度工作环境，可接受频繁出差及客户拜访。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw4kdGxHnoxHlExwQqQld8rqgUq&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;自驱力强，抗压能力好，能够在不确定环境中找到路径并推动落地。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJr0dGqEsovC7qxExSQl79YTgcb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;能够中英文双语工作（听说读写）；&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXBZdlH5qoJvf7xd85ElIj2Dggh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;本科及以上学历，金融、经济、会计、数学、统计、计算机等相关专业优先。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
